 "style": {
  "name": "Modern Contemporary",
  "summary": "Crisp white plaster volumes accented by a full-height grey stacked-stone pier, warm timber soffits and vertical wood louvers on the upper facade, frameless glass balcony railings over a 2-car porch, and black aluminium glazing with rooftop solar panels.",
