 },
 "notes": [
  "Compliant with LDA 10-marla rules: 10 ft front setback, 7 ft rear setback, and 5 ft right side space, keeping ground coverage at 1,440 sq ft (63.3% \u2264 70%).",
  "Front massing matches the concept image: a 16 ft wide 2-car porch on the left topped by a glass-railed balcony, a central stone-clad feature pier, and a right-hand bedroom with vertical timber louvers.",
  "The ground-floor TV lounge features a double-height void overlooked by the first-floor family lounge and gallery passage, with a tall 2.5\u00d79.5 ft window onto the porch providing >8% daylight.",
  "Dirty Kitchen on the ground floor and Kitchenette on the first floor are both sized at 6\u00d79 ft (54 sq ft \u2265 50 sq ft) along the 5 ft right side setback with dedicated 12 sq ft exterior windows.",
  "Master Bath faces the front balcony to receive direct natural ventilation (3 sq ft ventilator), ensuring all 6 baths and powder room have external openings."
 ],
